---
layout: layouts/staff.njk
staffPage: stewardship
staffNum: "03"
staffTitle: Stewardship
staffHeading: Who needs a <b>call</b>
staffHint: supporters — sorted worst first, click a row to open their record
---
<div class="tw">
  <table>
    <thead><tr>
      <th data-i18n="stew.person">Person</th><th data-i18n="stew.lastPersonal">Last personal contact</th><th data-i18n="stew.lastAny">Last contact (any)</th>
      <th data-i18n="stew.consent">Consent</th><th class="right" data-i18n="stew.touches">Touches</th>
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody id="rows"></tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<p class="note" data-i18n-html="stew.note"><b>Newsletters do not count as personal contact.</b> A bulk send is contact, but it is not
  a conversation — and a dashboard that conflates the two reports everyone as looked after
  when nobody has been called in months.</p>

{#- THE SUPPORTER DIALOG.

   A DIALOG RATHER THAN THE DRAWER IT REPLACES. The row used to expand into a
   read-only timeline underneath it, which was fine while there was nothing to
   do but read. Now there is: contact details, life events to write, a call to
   log. On a list sorted worst-first the person you want is near the top and
   the drawer pushed everyone else down the page while you worked — and a form
   inside a table row inherits the table's column widths, which is a fight not
   worth having.

   Same `.dlg` shell as the resource form and the confirm dialog, so there is
   ONE thing in this console that means "this is the only thing you are doing
   right now".

   EMPTY ON PURPOSE. Every field is filled by /api/staff-stewardship, which is
   the only endpoint that returns a supporter's email and phone, and which is
   asked for one person at a time. Nothing about anybody is in this page's
   HTML. -#}
<div class="dlg-back" id="swBack" hidden>
  <div class="dlg sw-dlg" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="swName">
    <button type="button" class="sw-close" id="swClose"
            data-i18n-attr="aria-label:common.close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>

    <h3 id="swName"></h3>
    <p class="sw-sub" id="swWhere"></p>

    <div class="tabs" role="tablist">
      <button type="button" class="tab" role="tab" data-swtab="facts"
              aria-selected="true" data-i18n="stew.tabFacts">Quick facts</button>
      <button type="button" class="tab" role="tab" data-swtab="events"
              aria-selected="false" data-i18n="stew.tabEvents">Life events</button>
      <button type="button" class="tab" role="tab" data-swtab="history"
              aria-selected="false" data-i18n="stew.tabHistory">History</button>
    </div>

    <section class="tab-panel" data-swpanel="facts" role="tabpanel">
      <dl class="sw-facts" id="swFacts"></dl>
    </section>

    <section class="tab-panel" data-swpanel="events" role="tabpanel" hidden>
      {#- What is known about this person, and what it is for. The note is not
         decoration: this is the most sensitive data the system holds, and the
         person writing into it should be reminded, at the moment of writing,
         that the subject is entitled to read it. -#}
      <div id="swEvents"></div>
      <p class="row-actions">
        <button class="ghost-btn" type="button" id="swAddEvent" data-i18n="stew.addEvent">+ Add a life event</button>
      </p>

      <form class="form sw-form" id="swEventForm" hidden>
        <input type="hidden" id="swEventId" value="">
        <label class="fld">
          <span data-i18n="stew.evKind">What happened</span>
          <select id="swEventKind">
            <option value="birth" data-i18n="stew.kind.birth">A birth</option>
            <option value="marriage" data-i18n="stew.kind.marriage">A marriage</option>
            <option value="bereavement" data-i18n="stew.kind.bereavement">A bereavement</option>
            <option value="illness" data-i18n="stew.kind.illness">Illness</option>
            <option value="job_change" data-i18n="stew.kind.job_change">A change of work</option>
            <option value="move" data-i18n="stew.kind.move">A move</option>
            <option value="baptism" data-i18n="stew.kind.baptism">A baptism</option>
            <option value="graduation" data-i18n="stew.kind.graduation">A graduation</option>
            <option value="retirement" data-i18n="stew.kind.retirement">Retirement</option>
            <option value="other" data-i18n="stew.kind.other">Something else</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="fld">
          <span data-i18n="stew.evDate">When — leave empty if it has not happened yet</span>
          <input type="date" id="swEventDate">
        </label>
        <textarea id="swEventNote" rows="3"
                  placeholder="What you want to remember"
                  data-i18n-attr="placeholder:stew.evNote,aria-label:stew.evNote"
                  aria-label="What you want to remember"></textarea>
        <label class="chk">
          <input type="checkbox" id="swEventRecurs">
          <span data-i18n="stew.evRecurs">This comes round every year</span>
        </label>
        <p class="hint" data-i18n="stew.evPrivacy">Write as though they will read it — on request, they are entitled to.</p>
        <div class="dlg-actions">
          <button class="ghost-btn" type="button" id="swEventCancel" data-i18n="common.cancel">Cancel</button>
          <button class="solid-btn" type="submit" data-i18n="stew.evSave">Save</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section class="tab-panel" data-swpanel="history" role="tabpanel" hidden>
      <p class="row-actions">
        <button class="ghost-btn" type="button" id="swAddTouch" data-i18n="stew.logContact">+ Log a contact</button>
      </p>

      {#- APPEND ONLY, and the form says so rather than the docs alone. There
         is no edit and no delete for an interaction: a contact log whose past
         can be rewritten is not a log. -#}
      <form class="form sw-form" id="swTouchForm" hidden>
        <label class="fld">
          <span data-i18n="stew.tcType">What kind of contact</span>
          <select id="swTouchType">
            <option value="call" data-i18n="stew.type.call">A phone call</option>
            <option value="text" data-i18n="stew.type.text">A text message</option>
            <option value="email" data-i18n="stew.type.email">An email</option>
            <option value="visit" data-i18n="stew.type.visit">A visit</option>
            <option value="meal" data-i18n="stew.type.meal">A meal together</option>
            <option value="video_call" data-i18n="stew.type.video_call">A video call</option>
            <option value="handwritten" data-i18n="stew.type.handwritten">A handwritten note</option>
            <option value="postal_mail" data-i18n="stew.type.postal_mail">Something posted</option>
            <option value="event" data-i18n="stew.type.event">At an event</option>
            <option value="other" data-i18n="stew.type.other">Something else</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="fld">
          <span data-i18n="stew.tcDate">When</span>
          <input type="date" id="swTouchDate" required>
        </label>
        <textarea id="swTouchNote" rows="3"
                  placeholder="Anything worth remembering (optional)"
                  data-i18n-attr="placeholder:stew.tcNote,aria-label:stew.tcNote"
                  aria-label="Anything worth remembering (optional)"></textarea>
        {#- THE ONE CONTROL THAT DECIDES WHAT THIS PAGE REPORTS. Checked by
           default, because somebody opening this form has almost always just
           spoken to a person; the case it exists for is the forward to forty
           that happens to have gone to this address too. -#}
        <label class="chk">
          <input type="checkbox" id="swTouchPersonal" checked>
          <span data-i18n="stew.tcPersonal">This was a real one-to-one conversation</span>
        </label>
        <p class="hint" data-i18n="stew.tcAppend">Logged contacts cannot be edited or removed afterwards. Correct a mistake by recording what actually happened.</p>
        <div class="dlg-actions">
          <button class="ghost-btn" type="button" id="swTouchCancel" data-i18n="common.cancel">Cancel</button>
          <button class="solid-btn" type="submit" data-i18n="stew.tcSave">Log it</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="swTimeline"></div>
    </section>

    <p class="hint" id="swStatus"></p>
  </div>
</div>
